#!/bin/sh
# 提交前自检：语法 + 署名一致性。缺 node 时静默跳过（不阻塞提交）。
command -v node >/dev/null 2>&1 || exit 0

fail=0
if ! node --check pt-suite.user.js; then
    echo "[pre-commit] ✗ pt-suite.user.js 语法错误"
    fail=1
fi
if ! node tools/verify-sign.mjs >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    echo "[pre-commit] ✗ 署名自检失败（改过版本号？跑 node tools/bump.mjs <版本>）"
    node tools/verify-sign.mjs | tail -n 6
    fail=1
fi
[ "$fail" -eq 0 ] && echo "[pre-commit] ✓ 语法与署名检查通过"
exit $fail
